        "1094",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a3a61414c6bb197be8b270e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強もセンターも譲らねえよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7308a9b78ebf18a4fc0a88a9f4e13212d81a5cf04c57a9e7cfa8b3012918588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8565b04cf8769799f720cf3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想像できねーだろ？\r\nこれ着た俺が負けるとこ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3965d5ecb71720fa0962ab7be4c65c241828355d771eaf5d292d85685b861104",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7517580b752e85f052360ab2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ着た俺を妹がかわいいってよ！\r\n参るね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bca87dfdc5a75b2a7bf05cb841f52898b5207cd9808e36837cdca7770c8e6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219b763697ff0130b0ed9409",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "電飾でも付けてぇな。\r\nライブ盛り上がりそうだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f9ca6a3cef215b18e52016862b52ba8e44cc373fa3bdf0ac2741898c50be65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33276ad578c43656d482fe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強ぇヤツと走らせろ。\r\n秒でわからせてやる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a96c9d8df145876e9733ece7d3431e7ac07c215de3ddb0e45dbbd0842f49ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d279268ef4b67a830f32600a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、惚れんなよ？\r\nなんてな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "083740f011405a3f1a4823f56dee6d68666a30f8e1608e135cfe7bc2e66f50fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b69934b4a83d613ba6f5640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうだ？なんでも似合っちまうよな～俺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25707872c02b7c999c40e76c34de5c0dfc347e69a9b4978c266f146ad077d09c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8684482b8f07d95a0669b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結構動きやすくってよ。\r\nタイマンもよゆーだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ac999f8e94a2d6072fbbe2150a6fddcfa30a186d7cd3ded806f09086d235b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eebc03d41350f79964a4b49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強もセンターも譲らねえよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7308a9b78ebf18a4fc0a88a9f4e13212d81a5cf04c57a9e7cfa8b3012918588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3190a82e2440586f18402e85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想像できねーだろ？\r\nこれ着た俺が負けるとこ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3965d5ecb71720fa0962ab7be4c65c241828355d771eaf5d292d85685b861104",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6150b87f9d714bd167802542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ着た俺を妹がかわいいってよ！\r\n参るね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bca87dfdc5a75b2a7bf05cb841f52898b5207cd9808e36837cdca7770c8e6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e54f4f5219516176926f79d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "電飾でも付けてぇな。\r\nライブ盛り上がりそうだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f9ca6a3cef215b18e52016862b52ba8e44cc373fa3bdf0ac2741898c50be65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca4a3f090289d7d8bca95f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強ぇヤツと走らせろ。\r\n秒でわからせてやる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a96c9d8df145876e9733ece7d3431e7ac07c215de3ddb0e45dbbd0842f49ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06eabeba8e129148a91037ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、惚れんなよ？\r\nなんてな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "083740f011405a3f1a4823f56dee6d68666a30f8e1608e135cfe7bc2e66f50fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601fcc6ca982013d7b2a6c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうだ？なんでも似合っちまうよな～俺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25707872c02b7c999c40e76c34de5c0dfc347e69a9b4978c266f146ad077d09c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e892ae85dbd46349f043f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よー、お疲れ",
      "source_fingerprint": "088e0491475643964ced291181d14d44b5dc513436500ac73c11e5d71f3d4ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d81e9e9b8bedd90e0e1ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんだ、眠ぃのかよ？\r\n…ワァァァァ！！っと。\r\nハハッ、どうだ？目ェ覚めたろ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac7bf4e2644caa8b7cae716b02e59d01bdfd5ee25f76f8f764b7e6f0b3170f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b20ad884a131a6284bde1f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あいつの手伝いっつーとビミョーに\r\nムカつく気もすっけどよ。ま、\r\nこうなったら逆に利用してやるぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "017ba540c97e1f70664cf681ae2fda072717c64be3f5ab67af53bfc660de17e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3492b10fdf5b7684b1b9a430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なにが研究終了だ！クソ、アレコレ\r\nこき使いやがって…逃がさねぇぞ！\r\nどこ行きやがった、出てきやがれ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "278cc064ee82ba793484c579a12b484af1ecc670ed26e74bb48ee06e50f32478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3515f1aa5b2459cf85cedc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いろいろ役立ちそうじゃねぇか！\r\nありがたくいただいとこーぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84d96629526784c5caba392e445e7e5e9c2c85a181ccfbe6bba48650211c123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdb184c58cf2f6d5c0bd9b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レポート使えば強くなれんだろ？\r\nそんなら、使うっきゃねぇだろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "669aaccf6fa363b2107045c7b355c961eae7efc770fe45bd932162451a51d172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d15016ad5c58bf8649900f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あいつに追いつくためだ…\r\n俺もやってやる――研究をなっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d31ba97744209a50bf1288c0a8976dd7209608ac153c91585db195aa4a4703a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c51bbff7b52df8c07afe736a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都合よく付き合わされたけどよ、\r\n…あいつがガチなのは伝わったぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acecd19217ca3c48c8f04cf1fa0a44b0dd3b91d5c8ea5abe52816e135ede652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312a431504f7a118fd4ec5e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なーんか早くに目が覚めてよ。\r\n気づいたらぶっ飛ばしててさ。\r\nやっぱ好きだわ、走んの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fccdbfb0db2e7ea594c7ae01608e14a0928850b4e44c20794361529572589237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305a47466f69a77e9c801fd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "購買にナシつけてくる。\r\n俺の問題だ…ついてくんなよ。\r\nぜってー苺パフェ置かしてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d34aa138bc5b53fb4028918b247488f8605c9b507421710612931297ddf821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65576f9b42ed3e1e36c37488",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ったくジョーダンのヤツ、昼休みに\r\nまた追試かよ…しゃーねぇ、教えて\r\nやっか――センコーからの逃げ方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f4cdef647dfe0a67bcb482b5eb807f1207aedf5a446b77f89e6aa6ee140454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e389c7bf83efc31bb62c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フリーの連中は夜も走っててさ。\r\nまあトラブルも起きがちでよ。\r\nのぞきに行ってやるかなー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1e8a01d35155aeade620273bcc50051180851173f4982c2e6c7f3cfe2b573de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74246fd710f7ed8fc30be56f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…もうこんな時間かよ？\r\nあー、たまには早く帰るか。\r\nトップロードが心配すっからさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea236a7d55fea0bb7f355dea9ec0b2c9775eba389cab981665b5ccb2746ec8ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e56feee822000fa31a2163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暖かくなるとよ、浮ついて\r\n気が大きくなるヤツいるよなー。\r\n…カラまれたらすぐ言えよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a18cb378bce5a2bc39b00cce94ea88152d64d7e22dfd13f570b0390f57f53e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bcce0c5f3210a0ce793f391",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日もバカみてぇにあちーな…。\r\n喉渇いた～、冷たいの寄越せ～。\r\nおごれおごれおごれ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caeb5a14d62eb5df3195d102c9524e7a5c35c42a7178a6ae26f1bab3c1168359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55ec7f07904f05075ca40661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落ち葉狩りだなんだ、ぬるいこと\r\n言ってんなよ。本気で狩りに\r\n行くぜ。全国の猛者共をよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21edcdf4e3dc5cf03561eba55268492e84cea44713da0c89c72ed6ede98917d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04e8501f18692555d06a69a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、ちょうどいいとこに来たな！\r\nみんなでおでんつつこうぜー♪\r\nおら、仕事なんかあとだあと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dbe271dec24236e21e49eea4e95a8b1f726352bc50291f385c9d66011f097fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3537c252ee0a7c7eccd62a59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cce409b5b975d94a2c31528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンツとの併走、ちぎってやったが\r\n…ありゃ負けたヤツの目じゃねぇ。\r\nまだまだ楽しめそーだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307c9d91ce11c070d0037e36c6b1957d0d5b88855cc3f17e082fb7ec2d30dd6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a187d65429e05f1b4bf785ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あいつ、まだ実力隠してやがんな…\r\nクソ！俺が引きずり出してやる！\r\n首洗って待っとけよ、タキオン…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f71408216a7b33c1fb30141f8eb7e5222d0f5f4215d63266bdbe1544f0b885c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb81a46d289fdd64903a6469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フライトに特服着せたら、\r\n完ぺきに着こなしやがってよー！\r\nまさか…どっかで頭はってたのか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d4858724d4d7653c74658ee8b1fcccc358732f5ec0a408aed20f74f987edaf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24345b92acd6d9ce716f17d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹が歌ってる動画をくれてさ！\r\n笑顔がかわいいのなんの…\r\n泣かすヤツいたら潰しちまうなー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d18f40c81786d698e0710cfa996ebdb6da819611f5e058493b233548c8e888f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a54141be5e67eaeafda8feb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "L/Roarsは実力が全て。上がるも\r\n落ちるもてめぇ次第…。\r\nシビれるだろ？最高のチームさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0525d4c2c804ea0dabc0abcd80040f071bcb3197a54f566910850db20a3698c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bc0ee5f00909c397c424f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フリー時代も踊ったなー。\r\n振り付けはテキトー…けど、\r\n同じ特服で気持ちは1つだった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfceaf125fe4c4552571aa3f863e3d931675d8a98b5afa69b74cfcd3321799e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f581506d940d331db7df352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスの練習、付き合えよ。\r\nダセェとこ見せらんねーからな。\r\nビシっと決めてこそウマ娘だろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2239549e3119b3a871e44a118a6c710b099befb29ea626fc643cd23176ee89c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca47dd8f0c8572b261432190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バカ強ぇヤツらと走らせろよ。\r\n勝負服が俺に言うんだ…\r\nブッちぎらせろ、ってなぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "404040e44b353701cb0da7b9713daced85a3ae903274a09d0d076f17fd0eb853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd43af2922f099a979121c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブーツはフリー時代と同じモンだ。\r\nみんなと踏んだ土がにじんでる…\r\n一生履き潰してやるつもりだぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53fe2a342d3958a45f9aeeadbc045e5c71a856e6766d19b5b1bf3e2202a7832d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a570a18a876ce64f4782a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フジさんに朝の挨拶したの、\r\n俺が1番ノリなんだぜ～！\r\nやー、楽しい1日になるなこりゃ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d27cdb20c758893a3a38ff97beab1f98489028c2a5ae29e02773e4acc6be33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38a086de3b288dab9c9dc3aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ま～たセンコーの呼び出しかよぉ。\r\n街でもめたアレ…いや、マナー悪い\r\n先輩詰めた時の…うーん、どれだ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07a646247edc68f6028c5aa1e127705e82443f3a31e5a64e47bddbb56b34ec7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6dd6d99f97dfb48b531442e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相手してやる。\r\nちゃんと楽しませろよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b881c3f12bd8ce7ac5074040e9c1b7ec5bfefdbdd097ca51b716ba5b58cbd53a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940792a4f221b5d0e34be24b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今夜、寮のテレビは俺のもんだ。\r\n誰が最強か、見届けてやる――\r\n楽しみ過ぎるぜ、『爆笑王』…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d3e6ab2de716939d3a40be96964335b099929e7fe81e8677e258e18da3aa76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9220913493fa90a40455aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新顔のヤツら気合い入ってんなー。\r\nいやぁ、よかったぜ。\r\n退屈しなくて済みそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a615783761e18139c13b2ca47a9056d2ad31476f89cd830af816d8f82934e4bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fe7b6d461c2bbd97623138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっちー…けど、フリーん時は\r\n関係なく走ってたなぁ…ハハッ。\r\n昔の自分にゃ負けらんねぇぜ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ea722036c7af8f12299bb63bcc43ca36ac551c3b7aa1c7cc969a4afbd898021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b3cbd1dfe571eaaa95ad3a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジャージに刺繍入れたくてよー。\r\nほら、芸術の秋って言うだろ？\r\nな、龍と虎、どっちが渋い？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eefdf17037e690fec6b2fc713fe7f11de0598a892a0477d12979e421dd545dac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba905cd630118b08bb24e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んぐ…またやっちまったー！\r\n俺を止めてくれ…塗ったそばから\r\nリップクリームなめちまうんだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b524e0158103d2a17a4e1f0c5991bb919c5f7e412d95db71b0e0e880b0ce66d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83752cee2b240c6646799f03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強の俺がトレーニングすんだ。\r\nハッ、強くなりすぎちまうな！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dcbcc6abc3da5f3922f896ebe3f9c197fbbb879f90ad865b7bdd99811508ae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c6174b8d1056346308baf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マジでいくぜ",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7371b3f897f20568e499138f2cf6ff75bd2f7501cfe8f504084803c2e17c5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df4df11d7e918d97536f861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "併走ジョートー。\r\n骨のあるヤツ連れてこいよ。\r\nじゃなきゃ意味がねェ…だろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b49eca3d4c62333f5ccb35564b66f1dcff69d17ab933a0aa8abedfbed874f159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cce59961cca3004cdb6c317",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オラ、お前も根性入れろ！\r\n空っぽになるまでやんぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a52e58cee9ccc48a24f2bd32140ed049cdcd5f327aac744a78260ed4bfdc03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e7de03ab2df312898f7e44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俺はハンパもんになりたくねー。\r\nレースも、トレーニングも、\r\n締めるとこは締めんぞ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab100dfeee33a1934190a858793a972782d137da19e67d111073605a33b9f7e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37487f0b5b78ad29294f3960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なあ、今日はどんなことすんだ？\r\n遠慮せずビシッと言えよ。\r\nちゃ～んと強くしてくれんだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "df09989ead7dd8c618e2be063956f055ec3dd7778d60e67ec545ef2553afce45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd7efc113d0f19c3ca7bda2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なっちまおうぜ、伝説に。\r\n俺たちなら目指せるって、\r\nマジで思ってんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e637f36679a2564d0fc0608922a25a2322697bd0e48e3ee3e189437553f3f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85be89349f7ead5a6a9aeb8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“最強”の俺！\r\n“最強の相棒”のお前！\r\nへへッ、俺たち無敵だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebf462ce00f96b0e42938d4f9486c37fa073f78d12e7271e8a0f854c300f6405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e5960902929384efee9b37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太陽のヤロー、ガンくれやがって。\r\n売られたケンカは買ってやる――\r\n沈むまでトレーニングだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb9f2a80a950de54ed1c7d23aac472385c3e84bde036cdd3f0ba6a4aea1d9b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28865ddcc6b2d540ef5b59f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俺たちが“最強”のコンビだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc653f67dea89558275e92ba84103e47cf972dfa62393c158b116b1a500f4da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29807ccf3e21fe46b8188799",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俺が“最強”だー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "774297dde8ad07758e08ffd959c1bd205ed9c9332f04ae574f7baa6f2da25b04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a81ab538f73da6ac64b797",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんかドリンク配れば配るほどスゲー報酬に\r\nなるってよ！　やるからにはテッペン目指そうぜ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0805434ec6dbb16c76f377a7965f3fce57bde3e1e0f902941495960d3f2d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8ff07458ece9526ba0f5d28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "獲ったな…テッペン！\r\nへへッ、フェス終わったら報酬もらいに行こーぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4278d4fc623ca5745525086801a3e152fefc2128299ac691f9731eebfd883e95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0976761868cfd974157f80bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハハッ、ブチ抜くぜェ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7239975096f322de5a2e1d3b1827cc02cca5d21ac235fd9779d7d94002d62f11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7b8f422a7e149fa6834cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界なんざ、あるわけねーだろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc65e81d3e2a885d04f6e56495a663c08f9efaccd11b7bdb80dffa8521b617e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e239e0a15f7e4f02e1c71c55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジャングルポケットだ。レースジョートー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd84d93e1e9c0e2b87de38f45ac3849cf5cd6093a4a4041f3777f302c64d8b2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0ae3b104e5f03c95dd6362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰が相手でもカンケーねぇ。\r\n“最強”は俺だ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4148a80fcd7a4a7836d3cd867f464296156347122407f9eabd6d95676b296c03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b259ebda21798705cac1704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的训练可是超严格的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9831300fd6d6ae0ae924362c11f517f60a1eeb961984bce311e3227d1d5a437a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f07fa96bd88e6c38221b7f35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限这种东西根本不存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "841ba1cdb7ae1b2f3926acecd143e7eb860db9f96937a059b1a0039b28cd1c6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efcf90a923b88796c223d00f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いざやいざや！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a263d0bdd020e1dcd7ad412c2e2988af262dd31dedcf39d667c3405cae854f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a492ae412cde97e66c98f5f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『天下統一』…よい響きだのう！\r\nふっふっふ…兵どもを蹴散らし\r\n勇猛果敢にのし上がってやるわい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c646158980d4e8cdbf02f9f7193ec481ccf07f0c207cd85825552046126b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bb4745c724f3cd15b6c74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "終わりよければすべてよし。途中の\r\n狼藉は水に…いや、盃のにんじん\r\nジュースに流せ！宴じゃ～い！",
      "source_fingerprint": "102ef827fef40427b394bea280a8b890afc865c794f5c975c96c79d899f6cb42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97da3d426d1eea75eb5e55e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントミッションじゃ！\r\nしかと務めを果たし、\r\n武勲を立ててまいろうぞっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4efdc4df0f19941ff4d96a978e69fbe7e9217d999e73576c379bf2d6950e216d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d775b8dd85b829a912afdc8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "褒美じゃ。\r\n忘れずに受け取れい！\r\n此度の働き、見事であったぞ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53f02d9b2fe13014e9274e4b11f2f649c1766417a35466cd9e6bf11ff96e7ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a89f4bef9d7687cc37273cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共に天下を獲ろうぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94a1358041c83e3bd76d608ceadc4fb82acd733dd5b24d4d62c04e13b5e5c8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d3b827d8471d16e4d090b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ワシを頼るとは見る眼がある！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dabd516d16cda4033a62ea1de9208a07c2dedac9f1748000103ad12ab4d7b99c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f90914c1300245121cb94ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このワシに果てなどなし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b14da9afff65d4bb24c1a7142e8f63568a73af7e3fae19d915a127dd34fcc6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1096",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b695268380bfe09ba83d6d43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…要出来了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b24766b4b5dbfc8d7067501a98df3c0dfb2f510819c16200e2586ce6b4e8713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae70ba5cfd5cfe18e16900f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…您，赐予了我祝福。\n若不在您身边，便无法感受到幸福\n…永续的，甜美祝福",
      "source_fingerprint": "c506fa5028e19212a0d8c3633bee4a1fd9611a47d41d6001df7cbfbe5777c8d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
